{"id":8167,"date":"2021-10-31T13:36:50","date_gmt":"2021-10-31T17:36:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8167"},"modified":"2021-11-01T17:15:48","modified_gmt":"2021-11-01T21:15:48","slug":"winslow-meteor-crater-az","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/10\/31\/winslow-meteor-crater-az\/","title":{"rendered":"Winslow &#038; Meteor Crater AZ"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>As we continued our trek back to Arizona for the winter, our final leg would be heading west on I-40 between Winslow and Flagstaff (and ultimately down to Casa Grande)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Winslow Arizona (you&#8217;ll remember <a href=\"https:\/\/arizonajourney.org\/standing-on-the-corner-winslow-arizona\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">&#8220;Standin&#8217; On The Corner&#8221;<\/a> by the Eagles) is a great stopping point as you&#8217;re heading west.  The town is a few blocks long and has only a handful of tourist trap type souvenir shops and another handful of restaurants.  Canned music plays from loudspeakers mounted on utility poles at the downtown square and there&#8217;s always other tourists checking out the corner while you&#8217;re there.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_093521860_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_093521860_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8198\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_093521860_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_093521860_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_093521860_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>The famous &#8220;Standin&#8217; On The<strong> Corner<\/strong>&#8220;<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>A short walk from an easily discovered parking spot got us down to the historic <a href=\"https:\/\/laposada.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">La Posada Hotel<\/a> and to walk through the lobby was worth it.  This is the last Fred Harvey Hotel built along the Santa Fe rail line in the &#8217;30s that&#8217;s still in operation.  The architecture and interior design are beautiful. You can read more about the <a href=\"https:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Fred_Harvey_Company\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Fred Harvey story here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017100832.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017100832.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8206\" class=\"wp-image-8206\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017100832.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017100832-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017100832-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100256842.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100256842.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8199\" class=\"wp-image-8199\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100256842.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100256842-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100256842-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100149262.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100149262.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8200\" class=\"wp-image-8200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100149262.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100149262-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_100149262-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_095339931.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_095339931.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8201\" class=\"wp-image-8201\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_095339931.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_095339931-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_095339931-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094631750.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094631750.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8202\" class=\"wp-image-8202\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094631750.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094631750-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094631750-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094530110.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094530110.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8203\" class=\"wp-image-8203\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094530110.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094530110-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094530110-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094346180.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094346180.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8204\" class=\"wp-image-8204\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094346180.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094346180-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094346180-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094246547.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094246547.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8205\" class=\"wp-image-8205\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094246547.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094246547-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_094246547-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">The La Posada Hotel<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After our stop at Winslow we traveled west to Exit #124 and visited <a href=\"https:\/\/meteorcrater.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">&#8220;Meteor Crater&#8221;<\/a>.  This crater is the largest and best preserved on planet earth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The crater was produced as the result of a falling meteorite traveling at an estimated 26,000 miles per hour.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Meteor Crater measures\u00a0<strong>0.75 miles (1.2 kilometers) across and about 600 feet (180 meters) deep<\/strong>. The size of the asteroid that produced the impact is uncertain\u2014likely in the range of 100 to 170 feet  across\u2014but it had to be large enough to excavate 175 million metric tons of rock.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can still see the remains of mining operations that took place during the 30&#8217;s through the 50&#8217;s.  The owner of the crater (Barringer) at that time was looking for anything of value that might have been left as a result of the explosion caused by the meteor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is where my Canon SX-60HS digital camera with it&#8217;s 1500mm zoom lens really came in handy!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>  The large picture below shows the overall view of the crater as seen from up on the observation deck at the rim.  The smaller photos at the top of the gallery below show close-up views of two of the mine shafts that were dug during explorations.  The steam boiler in the right-hand picture generated pressure to operate the lift winch (located behind the boiler).  The winch was used to bring materials up out of the shaft and take men and tools down into the shaft.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Clicking on any of the thumbnails in the gallery will open a larger view for you to be able to see.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124753.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124753.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8208\" class=\"wp-image-8208\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124753.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124753-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124753-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Fencing over one of the mine shafts<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124802.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124802.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8209\" class=\"wp-image-8209\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124802.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124802-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124802-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Another mine shaft at the bottom<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124808.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124808.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8210\" class=\"wp-image-8210\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124808.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124808-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124808-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Steam boiler machinery<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124104.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124104.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8211\" class=\"wp-image-8211\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124104.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124104-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211017124104-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The view from the top with the naked eye<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"720\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1280 \/ 720;\" width=\"1280\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Meteor-Crater.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>Short video of the crater (panoramic view)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We finished up our visit with WHAT ELSE but food?  We found what appeared to be a popular watering hole in Winslow and we decided it was time for lunch before moving on down the road to our final destination of Rover&#8217;s Roost at Casa Grande AZ.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It was a great decision.  Both couples split a meal and we&#8217;re so glad we did &#8212; the portions were HUGE (as Bernie would say)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_133445234.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_133445234.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8217\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_133445234.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_133445234-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_133445234-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>This is a half order of our Chicken Fiesta Salad<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-2 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130209961.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130209961.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8218\" class=\"wp-image-8218\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130209961.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130209961-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130209961-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130204439.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130204439.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8219\" class=\"wp-image-8219\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130204439.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130204439-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211017_130204439-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">The RelicRoad Brewery in Winslow Arizona<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We finally made it back to our &#8220;winter home&#8221; and have been settling in.  The park club functions will officially start Nov 1st but some of us early birds have been keeping busy in the meantime.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_171928533.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_171928533.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8226\" class=\"wp-image-8226\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_171928533.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_171928533-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_171928533-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Parked until January<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211025_124500984.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211025_124500984.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8223\" class=\"wp-image-8223\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211025_124500984.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211025_124500984-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211025_124500984-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Giving the coach a well deserved bath<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211029_143050487.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211029_143050487.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8222\" class=\"wp-image-8222\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211029_143050487.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211029_143050487-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211029_143050487-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Getting our cracked windshield replaced<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180341716.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180341716.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8221\" class=\"wp-image-8221\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180341716.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180341716-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180341716-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">An evening outdoor gathering<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180730617.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180730617.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8220\" class=\"wp-image-8220\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180730617.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180730617-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211031_180730617-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Spooks at the Halloween Party<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_180521328.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_180521328.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8224\" class=\"wp-image-8224\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_180521328.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_180521328-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_180521328-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Enjoying (NOT!) our new pet tarantula<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_175845060.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_175845060.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8225\" class=\"wp-image-8225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_175845060.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_175845060-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211023_175845060-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Enjoying each nights sunset<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211021_143142281.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211021_143142281.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8228\" class=\"wp-image-8228\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211021_143142281.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211021_143142281-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211021_143142281-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Repairing the water heater<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211030_161504791_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211030_161504791_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8229\" class=\"wp-image-8229\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211030_161504791_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211030_161504791_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211030_161504791_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Playing a little ham radio (in the shed)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_154540421.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_154540421.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8227\" class=\"wp-image-8227\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_154540421.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_154540421-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211019_154540421-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">A nite out to our favorite Chinese restaurant<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All in all, it has been a great trip across the northern plains and down through Wyoming, Utah, and Arizona.  We&#8217;ve seen a lot of beautiful landscape, hooked up with old friends along the way, met new folks that we can now consider friends, and continued to learn to love and appreciate each other as we continue this life adventure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for riding along, we will look for you on down the road.  I&#8217;ll be documenting some of our adventures while we are her for the winter, so there will be more to come.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In the meantime, be safe, be healthy and take care of each other as you travel this journey we call life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb and Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As we continued our trek back to Arizona for the winter, our final leg would be heading west on I-40 between Winslow and Flagstaff (and ultimately down to Casa Grande) Winslow Arizona (you&#8217;ll remember &#8220;Standin&#8217; On The Corner&#8221; by the Eagles) is a great stopping point as you&#8217;re heading west. The town is a few &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/10\/31\/winslow-meteor-crater-az\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Winslow &#038; Meteor Crater AZ<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,677,6120,554708025,19546,554708026,554707329],"tags":[24592,554708108,554708111,554707230,554708106,554708110,554708109,554707239,554708105,554708112,554708107,554707237],"class_list":["post-8167","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-friends","category-ham-radio","category-rving","category-sightseeing","category-touring","category-traveling","tag-arizona","tag-chinese","tag-final-leg","tag-food","tag-halloween","tag-hotel","tag-la-posada","tag-meteor-crater","tag-standin-on-the-corner","tag-trip-west","tag-water-heater","tag-winslow"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8167","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8167"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/